<h3>Complete Overview — Paragliding in Bir Billing</h3>
<p>    <!-- Highlights --></p>
<section class="bmt-section">
<h4>Paragliding in Bir Billing Highlights</h4>
<ul>
<li>Take off from Billing with certified pilots.</li>
<li>Experience Himalayan cold breeze &amp; clear valley views.</li>
<li>See tea gardens, deodar forests, and Dhauladhar ranges.</li>
<li>Views of Bir village, landing meadows, and Kangra valley.</li>
<li>Packages: Elite, Freespirit &amp; Daredevil.</li>
<li>Includes GoPro footage, insurance &amp; safety gear.</li>
<li>
          Instant booking, secure payments &amp; weather-flexible rescheduling.
        </li>
</ul>
</section>
<p>    <!-- Must Know --></p>
<section class="bmt-section">
<h4>Must Know</h4>
<ul>
<li>Flight duration: 15–70 mins based on package.</li>
<li>Timing: 8 AM – 5 PM.</li>
<li>Exact meeting point shared post-booking.</li>
<li>Age 16–50 yrs; Max weight 90 kg.</li>
<li>Jeep transfer included (meeting point ↔ takeoff/landing).</li>
<li>Weather delays possible (free reschedule).</li>
<li>Not suitable: pregnancy, recent surgery, back/neck issues.</li>
<li>Arrive 30 mins early.</li>
<li>No alcohol or heavy food before activity.</li>
<li>Carry ID — PAN not accepted.</li>
<li>No sharp objects / alcohol / large bags.</li>
</ul>
</section>
<p>    <!-- Things to Carry --></p>
<section class="bmt-section">
<h4>Things to Carry</h4>
<ul>
<li>Sports shoes with grip.</li>
<li>Windproof jacket (seasonal).</li>
<li>Sunglasses &amp; sunscreen.</li>
<li>Water bottle, light snack.</li>
<li>Valid ID.</li>
<li>Phone storage / pen drive for GoPro footage.</li>
</ul>
</section>
<p>    <!-- What to Expect --></p>
<section class="bmt-section">
<h4>What to Expect</h4>
<ul>
<li>Short jeep ride to take-off point.</li>
<li>Safety briefing &amp; gear check.</li>
<li>15–70 minute paragliding experience.</li>
<li>Views of Billing ridge, Bir valley &amp; Dhauladhar ranges.</li>
<li>Smooth landing.</li>
<li>GoPro footage + certificate (where applicable).</li>
</ul>
</section>
<p>    <!-- Do & Don't --></p>
<section class="bmt-section">
<h4>Do’s and Don’ts</h4>
<p class="bmt-subhead">Do’s</p>
<ul>
<li>Arrive 30 mins early.</li>
<li>Wear fitted clothing &amp; secure belongings.</li>
<li>Follow pilot instructions.</li>
<li>Inform pilot if you feel unwell anytime.</li>
</ul>
<p class="bmt-subhead">Don’ts</p>
<ul>
<li>No alcohol/smoking before or during activity.</li>
<li>No sharp objects or large bags.</li>
<li>Do not interfere with pilot controls.</li>
<li>Do not litter — respect the mountains.</li>
</ul>
</section>
<p>    <!-- How to Reach --></p>
<section class="bmt-section">
<h4>How to Reach</h4>
<p>Location: Bir Billing, Kangra (~15–20 mins from Bir town)</p>
<p class="bmt-subhead">By Air</p>
<ul>
<li>Kangra Airport — ~65–70 km / 2.5–3 hrs.</li>
<li>Direct flights from Delhi / Chandigarh / Amritsar.</li>
</ul>
<p class="bmt-subhead">By Train</p>
<ul>
<li>Pathankot — ~140 km (major broad-gauge railhead)</li>
<li>Ahju — ~3 km (nearest narrow-gauge station)</li>
</ul>
<p class="bmt-subhead">By Road</p>
<ul>
<li>Delhi — ~500 km (overnight Volvo options)</li>
<li>Chandigarh — ~290 km</li>
<li>Bir Bus Stand — ~10–15 mins</li>
</ul>
<p>
        <strong>Local Transfers:</strong> Provided for take-off &amp; landing.
